
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#3b0918">
<meta name="description" content="Lippan & Glow — a royal Diwali art experience by Fun Fam Club at Swinton House, Jaipur.">
<title>Lippan & Glow | Fun Fam Club Jaipur</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --wine: #3b0918;
  --maroon: #541327;
  --red: #70263a;
  --gold: #d7b36a;
  --gold-light: #f2dfb0;
  --cream: #faf5eb;
  --paper: #fffdf8;
  --ink: #28191a;
  --muted: #76666a;
  --serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
  --sans: 'DM Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scroll-padding-top: 25px;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  line-height: 1.65;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

body.modal-open { overflow: hidden; }

img { display: block; width: 100%; }

a { color: inherit; }

button { font: inherit; }

.wrap {
  width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 44px));
  margin-inline: auto;
}

.gold-text { color: var(--gold-light); }

.eyebrow {
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  font-size: .7rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.section {
  padding: 100px 0;
}

.section-heading {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  color: var(--wine);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5.5vw, 4.5rem);
  line-height: .98;
  margin: 12px 0 20px;
}

.section-copy {
  max-width: 560px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .95rem;
}

.gold-line {
  display: block;
  width: 58px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--gold);
  margin: 22px 0;
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 760px;
  color: var(--cream);
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, #762b40 0%, transparent 54%),
    linear-gradient(140deg, #270610, #4b1022 52%, #2d0712);
  overflow: hidden;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);
}

.hero::before,
.hero::after {
  content: "✦";
  position: absolute;
  color: var(--gold);
  opacity: .45;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.hero::before {
  top: 25%;
  left: 5%;
  font-size: 38px;
}

.hero::after {
  right: 7%;
  bottom: 16%;
  font-size: 25px;
}

.hero-pattern {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: .12;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 0 15px, var(--gold) 16px, transparent 17px);
  background-size: 52px 52px;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, black 25%, transparent 85%);
}

.topbar {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 24px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #d7b36a38;
  gap: 20px;
}

.brand {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 1.45rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  text-decoration: none;
}

.brand small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 7px;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: .57rem;
  letter-spacing: .23em;
  color: #f5e7ce;
}

.topbar-note {
  font-size: .7rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .14em;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  text-align: right;
}

.hero-content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 55px 0 76px;
}

.hero-kicker {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 13px;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.hero-kicker::before,
.hero-kicker::after {
  content: "";
  height: 1px;
  width: 35px;
  background: var(--gold);
}

h1 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: clamp(4.6rem, 11vw, 9rem);
  letter-spacing: -.055em;
  line-height: .78;
  margin: 25px 0 22px;
}

h1 span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin-top: 14px;
}

.hero-subtitle {
  color: #f6e7d7;
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.3vw, 1.7rem);
  margin: 28px 0 30px;
}

.hero-image-frame {
  position: relative;
  width: min(480px, 100%);
  margin: 0 auto 28px;
  padding: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  background: #f8ecd6;
  box-shadow: 0 25px 65px #16030a70;
  transform: rotate(-1deg);
  transition: transform .4s ease;
}

.hero-image-frame:hover { transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(-4px); }

.hero-image-frame img {
  height: 290px;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
}

.image-caption {
  padding: 8px 5px 1px;
  color: var(--wine);
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 1rem;
}

.hero-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px 22px;
  color: #f8ead6;
  font-size: .84rem;
  margin: 26px 0;
}

.hero-meta span { white-space: nowrap; }

.meta-star { color: var(--gold); }

.price-card {
  width: min(460px, 100%);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 23px 24px 25px;
  background: #2d0713b8;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px #19040a45;
}

.price-label {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  font-size: .69rem;
}

.price {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 4rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  margin: 5px 0;
}

.price-note {
  color: #f7e8d4;
  font-size: .79rem;
  margin: 8px 0 20px;
}

.coupon-note {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #d7b36a75;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  font-size: .78rem;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-height: 52px;
  padding: 14px 24px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  background: var(--gold);
  color: var(--wine);
  text-decoration: none;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: .78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  background: var(--gold-light);
}

.btn-outline {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  background: transparent;
}

.btn-outline:hover {
  color: var(--wine);
  background: var(--gold-light);
}

.price-card .btn { width: 100%; }

/* EXPERIENCE */

.experience {
  position: relative;
  background: var(--cream);
}

.experience-intro {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr .8fr;
  align-items: end;
  gap: 55px;
  margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.experience-intro .section-copy { margin-bottom: 5px; }

.experience-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  border-top: 1px solid #d9c9aa;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #d9c9aa;
}

.experience-card {
  padding: 30px 23px 32px;
  border-right: 1px solid #d9c9aa;
  transition: background .25s ease, transform .25s ease;
}

.experience-card:last-child { border-right: 0; }

.experience-card:hover {
  background: #f0e4cf;
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.experience-symbol {
  color: #9c7634;
  font-size: 1.8rem;
}

.experience-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 1.65rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--wine);
  margin: 14px 0 8px;
}

.experience-card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .83rem;
  margin: 0;
}

/* DIWALI MOMENT */

.diwwali {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 68px 0;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--cream);
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #74283d, transparent 75%),
    var(--wine);
  border-block: 1px solid var(--gold);
}

.diwwali .ornament {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  color: var(--gold);
}

.diwwali h2 {
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.8rem);
  line-height: 1;
  margin: 16px auto;
  max-width: 750px;
}

.diwwali p {
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  color: #f0dfd0;
  font-size: .9rem;
}

/* VENUE GALLERY */

.venue {
  background: var(--paper);
}

.venue-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: end;
  gap: 25px;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.venue-header .section-heading { max-width: 630px; }

.gallery-count {
  white-space: nowrap;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .75rem;
  padding-bottom: 10px;
}

.gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
}

.gallery-item {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 0;
  border: 1px solid #d8c49a;
  background: #eee2d2;
  cursor: zoom-in;
  text-align: left;
}

.gallery-item img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 350px;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);
}

.gallery-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.06); }

.gallery-item::after {
  content: "↗";
  position: absolute;
  right: 13px;
  top: 13px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  border: 1px solid #fff9;
  color: white;
  background: #2b091b85;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

.gallery-caption {
  display: block;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--wine);
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
}

.venue-note {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .76rem;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

/* EVENT DETAILS */

.details {
  background: #f1e7d6;
}

.details-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: .85fr 1fr;
  gap: 75px;
  align-items: start;
}

.details-intro {
  position: sticky;
  top: 24px;
}

.details-list {
  border-top: 1px solid #d3c09a;
}

.detail-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
  gap: 17px;
  padding: 22px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #d3c09a;
}

.detail-icon {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #96702e;
}

.detail-row h3 {
  margin: 0 0 5px;
  color: var(--wine);
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 1.45rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.detail-row p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: .86rem;
  color: var(--muted);
}

/* FINAL CTA */

.final-cta {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 90px 0;
  text-align: center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #70263a, transparent 68%),
    var(--wine);
  color: var(--cream);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--gold);
}

.final-cta .section-heading {
  color: var(--gold-light);
  max-width: 720px;
  margin-inline: auto;
}

.final-cta p {
  color: #f1e4d5;
  margin: 22px auto 30px;
  max-width: 540px;
  font-size: .9rem;
}

.final-cta .btn { min-width: 240px; }

/* FOOTER: T&Cs ONLY */

footer {
  padding: 25px 0;
  background: #270610;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid #d7b36a60;
}

.terms-toggle {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  font-size: .77rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  letter-spacing: .06em;
  padding: 6px 10px;
}

.terms-toggle:hover { color: white; }

.terms-panel {
  max-width: 750px;
  margin: 16px auto 0;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid #d7b36a50;
  color: #e9d9c7;
  font-size: .78rem;
  text-align: left;
}

.terms-panel[hidden] { display: none; }

.terms-panel ol { padding-left: 20px; }

.terms-panel li { margin: 8px 0; }

/* IMAGE LIGHTBOX */

.lightbox {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 24px;
  background: #16040ddd;
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  transition: opacity .25s, visibility .25s;
}

.lightbox.open {
  opacity: 1;
  visibility: visible;
}

.lightbox-content {
  position: relative;
  width: min(950px, 100%);
  max-height: 90vh;
}

.lightbox img {
  width: 100%;
  max-height: 78vh;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.lightbox-caption {
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  padding: 10px;
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-size: 1.2rem;
}

.lightbox-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: -42px;
  right: 0;
  width: 38px;
  height: 38px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  color: var(--gold-light);
  background: var(--wine);
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* MOBILE BOOKING BAR */

.mobile-bar {
  display: none;
}

/* MOTION */

.reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(22px);
  transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;
}

.reveal.visible {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    animation: none !important;
    transition: none !important;
  }

  .reveal {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 850px) {
  .section { padding: 75px 0; }

  .hero { min-height: auto; }

  .experience-intro {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .experience-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }

  .experience-card:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }

  .experience-card:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid #d9c9aa; }

  .gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }

  .gallery-item:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

  .gallery-item:first-child img { height: 350px; }

  .gallery-item img { height: 260px; }

  .details-layout { gap: 35px; }
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  body { padding-bottom: 74px; }

  .wrap { width: calc(100% - 34px); }

  .section { padding: 65px 0; }

  .topbar { padding: 19px 0; }

  .topbar-note { font-size: .59rem; }

  .hero-content { padding: 47px 0 52px; }

  .hero-kicker { font-size: .61rem; }

  h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 17vw, 6.5rem); }

  .hero-image-frame img { height: 245px; }

  .hero-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 7px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  .price-card { padding: 21px 17px; }

  .price { font-size: 3.5rem; }

  .section-heading { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 11vw, 3.5rem); }

  .experience-grid { gap: 0; }

  .experience-card { padding: 22px 15px 24px; }

  .experience-card h3 { font-size: 1.45rem; }

  .experience-card p { font-size: .79rem; }

  .diwwali { padding: 57px 0; }

  .venue-header {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 9px;
  }

  .gallery-item:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

  .gallery-item:first-child img { height: 250px; }

  .gallery-item img { height: 175px; }

  .gallery-caption {
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 9px 10px;
  }

  .gallery-item::after {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    right: 8px;
    top: 8px;
  }

  .details-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 25px; }

  .details-intro { position: static; }

  .final-cta { padding: 70px 0; }

  .mobile-bar {
    display: block;
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 50;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    padding: 10px 15px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    background: #300714f5;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gold);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .mobile-bar .btn {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 48px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-pattern"></div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#home" class="brand">
        Fun Fam Club
        <small>Jaipur · Creative Experiences</small>
      </a>
      <div class="topbar-note">A special Diwali edition<br>Sunday · 25 October</div>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow hero-kicker">An artful festive escape</p>

      <h1>Lippan <span>&amp; Glow</span></h1>

      <p class="hero-subtitle">A little tradition. A little sparkle. All you.</p>

      <div class="hero-image-frame">
        <img
          src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/27/ef/36/27ef36063d881e46c73c56ebaafd5482.jpg"
          alt="Decorative lotus-inspired Lippan art with mirror details"
          fetchpriority="high"
        >
        <div class="image-caption">Create something beautiful, with your own hands.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-meta">
        <span><span class="meta-star">✦</span> Sunday, 25 October 2026</span>
        <span><span class="meta-star">✦</span> 2 PM – 4 PM</span>
        <span><span class="meta-star">✦</span> Swinton House, Jaipur</span>
      </div>

      <div class="price-card">
        <div class="price-label">Your festive art experience</div>
        <div class="price">₹800 <span style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:400;">/ person</span></div>
        <p class="price-note">Everything you need to create and take home your own Lippan artwork.</p>
        <div class="coupon-note">
          <span aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
          ₹200 F&amp;B coupon included with ticket price
        </div>
        <a class="btn booking-link" href="#register">Reserve your spot <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <section class="section experience">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="experience-intro reveal">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#96702e;">The experience</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading">A festive ritual,<br>made by you.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-copy">
          This Diwali, step away from the usual plans and spend an afternoon creating something meaningful. Discover the beauty of Lippan art, add your own details, and take home a handmade piece for your festive space.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience-grid reveal">
        <article class="experience-card">
          <div class="experience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✧</div>
          <h3>Discover</h3>
          <p>Get introduced to Lippan art, its patterns, textures and mirror-work details.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="experience-card">
          <div class="experience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">❋</div>
          <h3>Create</h3>
          <p>Follow step-by-step guidance and bring your own design to life.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="experience-card">
          <div class="experience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◇</div>
          <h3>Unwind</h3>
          <p>Enjoy the cafe atmosphere with a ₹200 F&amp;B coupon included in your ticket.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="experience-card">
          <div class="experience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
          <h3>Take home</h3>
          <p>Leave with the Lippan art decor piece you created yourself.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="diwwali">
    <div class="wrap reveal">
      <div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true">✧ &nbsp; ✦ &nbsp; ✧</div>
      <h2>Make this Diwali a little more personal.</h2>
      <p>Less scrolling, more creating. An afternoon of art, festive charm and memories worth taking home.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section venue" id="venue">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="venue-header reveal">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#96702e;">The setting</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading">A beautiful place<br>to make beautiful things.</h2>
          <p class="section-copy">Join us at Swinton House, Jaipur, for a creative afternoon in a thoughtfully chosen cafe setting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-count">THE VENUE &nbsp;·&nbsp; 01 — 03</div>
      </div>

      <div class="gallery reveal">
        <!-- Replace these three image URLs with your approved Swinton House photographs if needed. -->
